  (text "Smart pen BLE tag - BC832 V1 (nRF52832). 2 x SR626W in series -> J1/J2. Separate passive NTAG213 tag is NOT on this board." (at 40.64 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 257f2348-e833-44e6-9d08-a9a4183ff2f9))
  (text "Q1 = reverse-polarity protection (drain to battery, source to VDD, gate to GND)." (at 40.64 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 07ac4a60-32fd-405e-ad79-2edceeb6a3c5))
  (text "L1 + L2 = DC-DC inductors required by BC832 V1 (DCC -> 10 uH -> 15 nH -> DEC4). Enable DCDC in firmware." (at 40.64 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 65f1fea8-5c7c-49ab-8e18-4bcfafbfb979))
  (text "No 32.768 kHz crystal: firmware must use the internal LF RC oscillator. Battery level: SAADC internal VDD channel (no divider)." (at 40.64 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b6f50e1c-25d7-458e-9f5b-7aaa2c36c891))
  (text "UNVERIFIED: BC832 land pattern (community footprints, not Fanstel's drawing); pin 3 = SWDIO per datasheet table. Run ERC before release." (at 40.64 50.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a017ca11-bb87-427a-9b2a-8459f0d362ae))
